      "items": [
        {
          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Site Admin,\n\n*I want* to configure the correct locales and URL structure for each of the 8 Zimmermann storefronts in SFCC Business Manager,\n\n*so that* each storefront serves the correct language(s) and operates on the correct URL path per market.\n\n----\n\nThis story is split out from SFCC-48 (8 Storefronts Setup) to allow storefront creation to proceed independently while locale and URL configuration is finalised. \n\nThis covers locale assignment per storefront, EU multi-language locale setup, and the URL path structure across all 8 storefronts.\n\n||*Storefront Name*||*SFCC Site ID*||*Locale(s)*||*URL Path*||\n|Australia (AU)|ZimmermannAU|en_AU|/en-au|\n|US Domestic|ZimmermannUS|en|*Root URL*\n(/us will be redirected to root URL)|\n|US International|ZimmermannUSIntl|en_CA|/en-ca|\n|UK (Domestic)|ZimmermannUK|en_GB|/uk|\n|EU (Domestic)|ZimmermannEU|en_FR\nfr_FR\nit_IT\nes_ES|/en-eu\n/fr-eu\n/es-eu\n/it-eu|\n|EU (International)|ZimmermannEUIntl|en_CH|/en-ch|\n|Hong Kong (International)|ZimmermannHK|en_HK|/hk|\n|Middle East (International)|ZimmermannME|en_AE|/en-ae|",
          "to_string": "*As a* Site Admin,\n\n*I want* to configure the correct locales and URL structure for each of the 8 Zimmermann storefronts in SFCC Business Manager,\n\n*so that* each storefront serves the correct language(s) and operates on the correct URL path per market.\n\n----\n\nThis story is split out from SFCC-48 (8 Storefronts Setup) to allow storefront creation to proceed independently while locale and URL configuration is finalised. \n\nThis covers locale assignment per storefront, EU multi-language locale setup, and the URL path structure across all 8 storefronts.\n\n||*Storefront Name*||*SFCC Site ID*||*Locale(s)*||*URL Path*||\n|Australia (AU)|ZimmermannAU|en_AU|/en-au|\n|US Domestic|ZimmermannUS|en|*Root URL*\n(/us will be redirected to root URL)|\n|US International|ZimmermannUSIntl|en_CA|/en-ca|\n|UK (Domestic)|ZimmermannUK|en_GB|/uk|\n|EU (Domestic)|ZimmermannEU|en_FR (default)\nfr_FR\nit_IT\nes_ES|/en-eu\n/fr-eu\n/es-eu\n/it-eu|\n|EU (International)|ZimmermannEUIntl|en_CH|/en-ch|\n|Hong Kong (International)|ZimmermannHK|en_HK|/hk|\n|Middle East (International)|ZimmermannME|en_AE|/en-ae|"
        }
      ],
